  "LIMITED TIME ONLY/∆ TWISTED FLAMINGO, 10 OZ": {
   "skip": "Sonic prints this row at 700 cal with 21 g fat, 13 g saturated fat, 85 mg cholesterol and 9 g protein -- a dairy profile. Every other Twisted Flamingo size, in this same table and again under Specialty Sodas, is 0.5-3 g fat and 0-2 g protein, and the drink is a slush. The row contradicts the five sizes either side of it, and the same figures appear nowhere else in the brochure. Two independent PDF extractors read it identically, so it is Sonic's misprint, not a parse error. Twisted Flamingo ships from the Specialty Sodas table, where it is published complete at all five cup sizes."
